Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,-1:59:59.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,465)}H008  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,-1:59:59.60,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}夕食のテーブル
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:01:19.92,Header,,0,0,0,,H008  •  will と be going to の使い分け
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,English,,0,0,0,,In the evening the family gathered at the dinner table.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.98,0:00:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,Mother was finishing the meal preparations.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,Father said, I am going to have a drink tonight.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.04,0:00:17.98,English,,0,0,0,,He had already made up his mind.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.98,0:00:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,Sister wanted to discuss the trip.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.60,0:00:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,She proposed that I go with her.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.36,0:00:33.86,English,,0,0,0,,My brother offered, I will drive you both to the airport next weekend.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.86,0:00:37.06,English,,0,0,0,,Mother mentioned a new recipe.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.14,0:00:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,Father admitted, If you make pasta, I will help.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,He is good at cooking.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.50,English,,0,0,0,,What shall we do about dinner tomorrow?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.96,0:00:47.98,English,,0,0,0,,sister asked.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.98,0:00:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,Mother answered at once, I will make it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.04,0:00:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,I added my own suggestion: I will make a salad.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.16,0:01:02.54,English,,0,0,0,,Several small decisions fell into place around the table.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.54,0:01:07.38,English,,0,0,0,,Father, from his usual seat, said he would prefer fish.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.38,0:01:13.06,English,,0,0,0,,Sister gave him a small nod and confirmed the plan.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.06,0:01:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,Dinner flowed slowly, more slowly than usual.
